      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Richlands’ downtown and the Tazewell Avenue Historic District are listed on the National Register of Historic Places, preserving its 19th‑century architecture.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Richlands%2C_Virginia",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Richlands sits along the Clinch River just east of the Tazewell‑Russell county line, giving it a scenic riverfront backdrop.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
